    "set": [
      {
        "property": {
          "$bytes": "a126ca530c8e48d5b88882c734c38935"
        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "ERIC catalog metadata",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "property": {
          "$bytes": "e3e363d1dd294ccb8e6ff3b76d99bc33"
        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "## Catalog metadata\n\n- **Steward:** Institute of Education Sciences.\n- **Access:** Public search interface and JSON API; use bounded query exports.\n- **Unit:** Bibliographic research record.\n- **Coverage:** 1966 onward; continuously indexed.\n- **Geography:** Study-dependent.\n- **Join keys:** ERIC number, DOI, title, authors, and publication year.\n- **Contents:** Citation metadata, abstracts, descriptors, publication type, and full-text links when available.\n- **Uses:** Evidence discovery, source verification, and research-synthesis discovery.\n\nERIC is discovery metadata, not an intervention-outcome dataset. Preserve the query and retrieval date for each bounded export, and cite the underlying study when publishing a factual claim.",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      }
    ],
    "unset": []
  },
